<title>USA: NCAA-MEN'S COLLEGE BASKETBALL TOURNAMENT RESULTS.</title>
<headline>NCAA-MEN'S COLLEGE BASKETBALL TOURNAMENT RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>First round results in the</p>
<p>1997 NCAA men's college basketball tournament Friday (prefix</p>
<p>number denotes regional seeding):</p>
<p>East Region (at Pittsburgh)</p>
<p> 10-Texas		 71   7-Wisconsin	  58</p>
<p> 15-Coppin State	78   2-South Carolina   65</p>
<p>3-New Mexico v 14 Old Dominion</p>
<p>6-Louisville v 11-Massachusets</p>
